---
import Layout from '../../../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout lang="en" title="Workshop Stunt & Stage Combat — Ilian Simeonow"  description="Stunt, film and stage combat workshop with Ilian Simeonow. For actors, schools, theatre groups and individuals." heroImage="/images/stunt/Fenstersturz-2.jpg">

  <div class="page-hero page-hero--workshop">
    <div class="hero-top-bar"></div>
    <div class="page-hero-content">
      <div class="section-label">// Workshop · 02</div>
      <h1 class="page-hero-title">Workshop<br /><span style="color: var(--orange);">Stunt</span></h1>
      <p class="page-hero-sub">Stunt · Stage Combat · Acting · Action Riding</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <article class="article-section">
    <div class="article-grid">
      <div class="article-body">
        <p class="article-intro">
          The Stunt Workshop gives you intensive insight into stunt work, stage combat and acting. Ilian Simeonow develops choreographies with you, creates demo reel material and opens the world of professional stunt performance.
        </p>

        <h2 class="article-h2">What This Workshop Offers</h2>
        <p>Depending on your goals, we work on everything from small to large choreographies — for stage productions, dance performances or film scenes — right up to complete stage pieces. Need material for your demo reel? That's guaranteed to make an impression.</p>
        <p>Schools and classes can also book an unforgettable day — perfect for sports days or class events. Ilian comes to you, or you come to him.</p>

        <h2 class="article-h2">Who Is This Workshop For?</h2>
        <p>Primarily aimed at actors, amateur performers, theatre initiatives, theatres, clubs, martial arts schools and students. Anyone with genuine enthusiasm and a serious interest in learning is welcome.</p>

        <h2 class="article-h2">What Will You Learn?</h2>
        <p>Key elements of the course:</p>
        <ul class="article-list">
          <li><strong>Stunt & Fall Technique</strong> — safe falling, body control</li>
          <li><strong>Film & Stage Combat</strong> — choreography, timing, illusion</li>
          <li><strong>Acting & Pantomime</strong> — authentic performance of stunts</li>
          <li><strong>Reaction & Stretching</strong></li>
          <li><strong>Gymnastics & Acrobatics</strong> — fundamentals</li>
          <li><strong>Stick & Sword Fighting</strong> — fencing basics</li>
          <li><strong>Body Stunt & Jumps</strong></li>
          <li><strong>Camera Work</strong> — correct positioning, selling falls convincingly</li>
        </ul>

        <h2 class="article-h2">What to Bring</h2>
        <ul class="article-list">
          <li>Comfortable sportswear</li>
          <li>Indoor sports shoes</li>
          <li>Good mood</li>
        </ul>
        <p>For schools or groups of 5+ people outside Dresden, a sports hall or comparable space is helpful. Everything else is provided.</p>

        <h2 class="article-h2">Weekend Workshop: Action Riding</h2>
        <p>There is also the option of joining a dedicated Action Riding weekend workshop. This specialist workshop takes place only in March/April and October/November, and is aimed at experienced riders or stuntmen who want to develop their stunt riding skills.</p>
        <p>The weekend takes place in Leuthen. Horses and limited accommodation are provided. Power, water and sanitary facilities are available; tents are also welcome.</p>

        <div class="price-table">
          <div class="section-label">// Action Riding Weekend Prices</div>
          <div class="price-row"><span>2 days with accommodation</span><span class="price">€250</span></div>
          <div class="price-row"><span>2 days without accommodation</span><span class="price">€200</span></div>
          <div class="price-row price-row--reduced"><span>Students, pupils, unemployed (no accommodation)</span><span class="price">€150</span></div>
          <p class="price-note">All prices plus VAT and travel costs (€0.30/km). Places are limited.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="article-callout">
          <div class="section-label">// Booking</div>
          <p>Request a non-binding offer for the Stunt Workshop or Action Riding Weekend — Ilian responds personally to every serious enquiry.</p>
          <a href="/en/contact/" class="link-more">Get in Touch →</a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <aside class="article-sidebar">
        <div class="sidebar-label">// Other Workshops</div>
        <nav class="sidebar-nav">
          <a href="/en/workshops/fencing/" class="sidebar-link">Stage Fencing Workshop</a>
          <a href="/en/workshops/youth-circus/" class="sidebar-link">Youth Circus Workshop</a>
        </nav>
        <div style="margin-top: 40px;">
          <div class="sidebar-label">// Booking</div>
          <p style="font-family: var(--font-sans); font-size: 13px; color: var(--gray); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 16px;">Book a workshop or request an offer — Ilian responds personally.</p>
          <a href="/en/contact/" class="btn-primary" style="display: block; text-align: center;">Get in Touch</a>
        </div>
        <div style="margin-top: 32px;">
          <div class="sidebar-label">// About Ilian</div>
          <p style="font-family: var(--font-sans); font-size: 13px; color: var(--gray); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 16px;">23+ years as stuntman, stunt coordinator and fight choreographer.</p>
          <a href="/en/biography/" class="btn-outline-orange" style="display: block; text-align: center; padding: 12px;">Read Biography</a>
        </div>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </article>

</Layout>

<style>
.article-section { padding: var(--section-pad) var(--page-pad); background: var(--black); border-top: 1px solid var(--border); }
.article-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 2fr 1fr; gap: 80px; align-items: start; }
.article-intro { font-family: var(--font-serif); font-size: 20px; color: var(--white); line-height: 1.5; margin-bottom: 40px; padding-bottom: 40px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); }
.article-h2 { font-family: var(--font-serif); font-size: 24px; color: var(--white); font-weight: bold; margin: 40px 0 16px; }
.article-body p { font-family: var(--font-sans); font-size: 16px; color: var(--gray); line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 16px; }
.article-list { margin: 16px 0 16px 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px; }
.article-list li { font-family: var(--font-sans); font-size: 15px; color: var(--gray); padding-left: 20px; position: relative; }
.article-list li::before { content: ''; position: absolute; left: 0; top: 9px; width: 5px; height: 5px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--orange); }
.article-list li strong { color: var(--white); }
.price-table { background: var(--card); border: 1px solid var(--border); padding: 28px 24px; margin: 40px 0; }
.price-row { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; padding: 12px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); font-family: var(--font-sans); font-size: 15px; color: var(--gray); }
.price-row--reduced { opacity: 0.8; }
.price { color: var(--orange); font-weight: 700; }
.price-note { font-family: var(--font-sans); font-size: 12px; color: var(--gray); margin-top: 16px; line-height: 1.6; }
.article-callout { background: var(--card); border-left: 3px solid var(--orange); padding: 28px 24px; margin-top: 48px; }
.article-callout p { font-family: var(--font-sans); font-size: 15px; color: var(--gray); line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px; }
.article-sidebar { position: sticky; top: 88px; }
.sidebar-label { font-family: var(--font-sans); font-size: 10px; letter-spacing: 3px; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--orange); font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px; }
.sidebar-nav { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 1px; background: var(--border); }
.sidebar-link { font-family: var(--font-sans); font-size: 14px; color: var(--gray); padding: 14px 16px; background: var(--card); display: block; transition: color 0.2s, background 0.2s; }
.sidebar-link:hover { color: var(--white); background: var(--black); }
</style>
